{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：12:51 2026-08-08 HKT</p>\n\n<p>旺角登打士街1號一間酒店對開，今（8日)早上11時34分，一名女子疑由高處墮下，昏迷不醒，救護員接報到場，經檢驗後證實女事主當場死亡。警方正調查其身份及墮樓原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"女子墮酒店對開當場不治。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bc8a68cb713a795c1113b33a42d6b24b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_31_2_-_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方檢獲女死者手機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a4e8a9aca11202c7480b54e89287c940/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_31_-_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/949c281c88b519e9f7cdcbc8fb473196/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_30_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aa4e03686770a96597c8043c282fd512/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_30_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子墮酒店對開。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6d1d9e95e48d979033071974be8d7c04/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子墮酒店對開當場不治。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ca9f917ff9fc226076a4f1e90e857033/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_28_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9e1ae0580a0f49c33345e42d7b62dd3e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_28_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子墮酒店對開當場不治。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4611f00bc98073227bbcf519050ba02f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-08_at_12_39_28.jpeg\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T04:58:22.584518+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}